{
  "info": {
    "name": "Exati ITG API",
    "description": "# Exati ITG REST API\n\nReady-to-use Postman collection for the Spring Boot 3 API.\n\n## How to use\n\n1. Import this collection into Postman (File → Import).\n2. The collection ships with these variables — adjust if needed:\n   - `baseUrl` — defaults to `http://localhost:8080`\n   - `username` — defaults to `alice`\n   - `password` — defaults to `password-strong-1`\n   - `accessToken` — populated automatically by **Register** or **Login**\n3. Boot the API locally:\n   ```powershell\n   .\\gradlew.bat bootRun\n   ```\n4. Run requests in this order the first time:\n   - **Auth → Register**  (creates the user and stores `accessToken`)\n   - **Protected → Ping** (uses the stored token)\n\n## Authentication model\n\n- **Mechanism:** JWT Bearer token (HS256), validity 60 minutes.\n- **Header:** `Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>` on every protected route.\n- **Open routes:** `/api/v1/auth/**`, `/actuator/health|info|prometheus`, `/v3/api-docs/**`, `/swagger-ui/**`, `/h2-console/**`.\n- **Protected:** everything else under `/api/v1/**`.\n\n## Error model (RFC 7807)\n\nAll failures (auth + business) return `application/problem+json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\":   \"about:blank\",\n  \"title\":  \"Unauthorized\",\n  \"status\": 401,\n  \"detail\": \"Authentication required.\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-30T13:00:00Z\"\n}\n```\n\n## Rules\n\n- Username: 3–64 chars, must be unique (409 on conflict).\n- Password: 8–128 chars (400 on validation failure).\n- Tokens are **stateless** — there is no logout endpoint; let them expire.\n- Passwords are stored as **BCrypt** hashes; never logged.\n- Schema is managed by **Flyway** — Hibernate `ddl-auto: none`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "username",
      "value": "alice",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": "password-strong-1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Open endpoints — no Bearer token required. **Register** and **Login** both populate the `accessToken` collection variable on success, so subsequent protected requests work without manual copy-paste.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Create a new user account.\n\n**Status codes**\n- `201 Created` — user created, response body has `accessToken`\n- `400 Bad Request` — validation failure (username < 3 chars, password < 8 chars, missing fields)\n- `409 Conflict` — username already exists\n\n**Test script** stores `accessToken` into the collection variable."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('accessToken returned', () => pm.expect(body.accessToken).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "console.log('Saved accessToken (expires ' + body.expiresAt + ')');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 Created",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"alice\",\n  \"password\": \"password-strong-1\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register"
                }
              },
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"tokenType\": \"Bearer\",\n  \"accessToken\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhbGljZSIsImlhdCI6MTcxOTc0NDAwMCwiZXhwIjoxNzE5NzQ3NjAwfQ.signature\",\n  \"expiresAt\": \"2026-06-30T14:00:00Z\",\n  \"username\": \"alice\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "409 Conflict",
              "status": "Conflict",
              "code": 409,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/problem+json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"type\": \"about:blank\",\n  \"title\": \"Conflict\",\n  \"status\": 409,\n  \"detail\": \"Username already taken: alice\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-30T13:00:00Z\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 Bad Request",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/problem+json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"type\": \"about:blank\",\n  \"title\": \"Bad Request\",\n  \"status\": 400,\n  \"detail\": \"password: size must be between 8 and 128\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-30T13:00:00Z\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
